          <q>Gemini CLI changes the SRE workflow from manually operating tools to supervising an agent that: classifies incident symptoms, selects mitigation playbooks, executes approved tools, analyzes failures, investigates source code, generates a code patch, rolls the patch out to production, creates postmortem documentation, files action items.</q>
